1
00:00:01,418 --> 00:00:02,961
I'm afraid
you'll get in trouble

2
00:00:06,089 --> 00:00:07,799
because of
my feelings for you

3
00:00:07,925 --> 00:00:09,343
I heard it from Soobin

4
00:00:12,679 --> 00:00:14,306
16 years ago
at the shooting set

5
00:00:15,432 --> 00:00:18,352
the kid who came to see
me every day was you

6
00:00:18,477 --> 00:00:20,520
Why haven't you
told me so far?

7
00:00:20,646 --> 00:00:21,772
I don't know

8
00:00:23,941 --> 00:00:24,941
I just…

9
00:00:25,817 --> 00:00:28,737
Maybe I wanted
a fresh start

10
00:00:30,822 --> 00:00:34,204
I didn't wanna
confuse you

11
00:00:34,288 --> 00:00:35,288
with such things

12
00:00:35,369 --> 00:00:36,370
I'm not confused

13
00:00:39,706 --> 00:00:41,124
I like you too

14
00:00:48,131 --> 00:00:49,150
[To Shin Yoo-il
Thank you, Lee Hyesung!]

15
00:00:49,174 --> 00:00:50,174
What's this?

16
00:00:52,135 --> 00:00:53,135
It's my autograph

17
00:00:54,179 --> 00:00:55,347
Hey, what's this?

18
00:00:55,472 --> 00:00:56,948
Four years ago

19
00:00:57,032 --> 00:00:59,559
when the short film
was screened

20
00:00:59,685 --> 00:01:01,186
you came to the theater

21
00:01:01,311 --> 00:01:02,497
I got your autograph
at that time

22
00:01:02,521 --> 00:01:03,772
It's unbelievable

23
00:01:04,398 --> 00:01:06,091
What…

24
00:01:06,483 --> 00:01:08,277
You really liked me

25
00:01:08,568 --> 00:01:10,862
Hey, are you a stalker
or something?

26
00:01:10,946 --> 00:01:12,656
Stalker? Come on

27
00:01:12,781 --> 00:01:13,865
I was just a fan

28
00:01:15,993 --> 00:01:17,578
But I remember
that moment

29
00:01:17,744 --> 00:01:18,744
Really?

30
00:01:18,787 --> 00:01:19,787
Yeah

31
00:01:19,997 --> 00:01:21,158
That was my first
autograph

32
00:01:21,242 --> 00:01:22,874
as an adult actor

33
00:01:24,042 --> 00:01:27,170
I'd been thinking
of quitting acting, but

34
00:01:28,839 --> 00:01:31,216
after autographing
my fan like that

35
00:01:32,592 --> 00:01:35,345
I was motivated
to start over

36
00:01:35,470 --> 00:01:37,514
I'm glad
I've been keeping it

37
00:01:37,598 --> 00:01:38,992
It's Lee Hyesung's
first autograph, right?

38
00:01:39,016 --> 00:01:40,216
I should keep it
as an heirloom

39
00:01:40,517 --> 00:01:41,768
You liked me so much

40
00:01:42,894 --> 00:01:44,534
It must've been hard
for you to hold it up

41
00:01:45,939 --> 00:01:47,811
That's why I spit it out

42
00:01:47,894 --> 00:01:48,894
that I like you
